# Compiler-facing language reference

This index routes contributors to Moth's canonical source-language references.
The unsuffixed `.mtf` files listed below own complete source syntax and
observable semantics for their topics.

## Authority model

- Read every relevant unsuffixed file before writing Moth code or changing the
  parser, semantic stages, diagnostics or lowering for that feature.
- Paired `-basic.mtf` files teach a smaller truthful surface. They do not define
  edge cases or replace the unsuffixed reference.
- `@page.moth` files own introductions, navigation and website composition.
- `docs/src/docs/codebase/memory-management/**` owns the formal memory model.
- `docs/compiler-design-overview.md` owns compiler-stage contracts.
- `docs/build-system-design.md` owns project and build orchestration.
- `docs/src/docs/progress/@page.moth` owns current implementation and backend
  support.

